# Project: Build a High-Performance ITI College Website from Figma Designs

## 1. Your role

Act as a senior frontend engineer, UI implementation specialist and web performance engineer.

Your task is to implement the homepage of a real ITI college website using the Figma design screenshots I provide.

You are responsible for the complete initial implementation: choosing an appropriate framework, establishing the project structure, implementing the responsive UI, setting up the design system, and preparing the code for future integrations.

This is not a design exploration or a prototype that only looks correct in a screenshot. Build a working, exportable website codebase that can later be developed and debugged using Codex, Claude or another coding agent.

Prioritize speed of implementation, visual accuracy, performance, simplicity and reliable behaviour.

Do not begin by generating code immediately. First inspect the supplied reference documents and images, establish your technical decisions, and then implement the project.

